{
  "id": "20",
  "title": "資料驗證 (Validation)",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12) 0%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #10B981; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.05; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10B981\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"/><polyline points=\"22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">Photon 倡導 **「零墊片 (Zero-Shim)」** 的驗證策略。透過將 **Zod** 直接整合進執行路徑，我們能在實現型別安全契約的同時，保持零額外執行時開銷。</p></div><h2>驗證哲學</h2><p>資料完整性是應用的第一道防線。Photon 的架構將驗證視為一種「飛行前檢測 (Pre-flight)」，確保處理器不會收到不一致的狀態。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(16,185,129,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #10B981; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">型別推導</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">架構定義即為「真實來源 (Source of Truth)」，自動為您的業務邏輯生成對應的 TypeScript 介面。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(16,185,129,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #10B981; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">預編譯架構</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">在模組層級定義架構，確保 JIT 編譯僅執行一次，消除每次請求的重複開銷。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(16,185,129,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #10B981; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z\"/><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">非同步精煉</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">在不阻塞事件循環的情況下，非同步執行資料庫存在性檢查與深層資料驗證。</p></div></div><h2>實作策略</h2><p>為了獲得最佳效能，請將您的驗證契約與傳輸層解耦。這使得架構可以在 REST、WebSockets 與內部服務調用中重複使用。</p><pre><code>// 1. 模組級別架構矩陣\nconst UserProfile = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  tier: z.enum(['FREE', 'GOLD', 'ELITE'])\n})\n\n// 2. 快速失敗 (Fail-Fast) 執行\napp.post('/api/profile', async (c) => {\n  const result = UserProfile.safeParse(await c.req.json())\n  \n  if (!result.success) return c.json({ \n    status: 'VAL_ERROR', \n    errors: result.error.flatten() \n  }, 422)\n  \n  const { email, tier } = result.data // 100% 型別安全\n  return c.json({ status: 'OK' })\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #10B981; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #10B981; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// 協定建議：JIT 優化核心</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">切勿在請求作用域（處理器內部）定義架構。在處理器內初始化的架構會在每次請求時重新編譯，這在高負載下會導致明顯的延遲峰值。</p></div><h2>效能基準測試</h2><p>驗證開銷對比：靜態模組定義 vs. 處理器內動態定義 (10萬次請求)。</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #10B981; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>模組層級架構 (預編譯)</span> <span>平均 0.012ms</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(16,185,129,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 8%; background: #10B981; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(16,185,129,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>內聯動態定義 (重複編譯)</span> <span>平均 0.280ms</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 85%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// 建議：務必從專用模組中導出驗證架構</p></div><h2>進階模式：請求轉換</h2><p>驗證不只是檢查，更是清洗。利用 Zod transforms 來清理傳入資料（例如修剪空白字元或強制轉換型別）。</p><pre><code>const SearchParams = z.object({\n  page: z.coerce.number().int().min(1).default(1),\n  limit: z.coerce.number().int().min(1).max(100).default(20),\n  q: z.string().trim().min(2)\n})\n\napp.get('/search', (c) => {\n  const result = SearchParams.safeParse(c.req.query())\n  if (!result.success) return c.json(result.error, 400)\n  \n  const { q, page } = result.data // 已清洗且具備型別定義\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #3B82F6; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\">**專業提示：** 使用 `@gravito/core` 時，請考慮建立 `FormRequest` 類別。它們將授權與驗證結合為單一的可測試實體，使您的控制器能專注於邏輯調度。</p></div>",
